  "title": "Introducing our New Snapchat Family Safety Hub",
  "summary": "We’re excited to share our new Snapchat Family Safety Hub, developed with guidance from Common Sense Media. Our new Family Hub is designed to help families navigate Snapchat safely and confidently. As part of our continued efforts to support families, the site offers comprehensive resources and information to equip parents and teens with essential tools to support their safety and digital well-being.",
